{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"4655d9c4d05ddf9f","name":"card_unit_67th_baranovichi","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/WinterWar/units/card_unit_67th_baranovichi","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"67th BARANOVICHI","text":"Your LIGHT INFANTRY units have Alpine.","flavorText":"The 67th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 20th Rifle Division of the Red Army during WWII. The division was first formed during the Russian Civil War and fought with the Red Army between 1919 and 1921, and disbanded afterwards. In 1944 it was formed again and saw extensive combat in operations such as Operation Bagration, the East Prussian Offensive and Prague Offensive, and it ended the war near Berlin with the 28th Army of the 1st Ukrainian Front. The division was awarded the Order of the Red Banner during the war, and received the honorific title \"Baranovichi\". It was also awarded the Order of Suvorov 2nd class. The 20th Rifle Division was transferred to Lida with the 28th Army after the war and disbanded in July 1946.","faction":"Soviet","type":"infantry","rarity":"Rare","cost":3,"operationCost":1,"attack":2,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_67th_baranovichi","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_67th_baranovichi_title","SourceString":"67th BARANOVICHI","LocalizedString":"67th BARANOVICHI"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":2,"defense":3,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_67th_baranovichi_text","SourceString":"Your LIGHT INFANTRY units have Alpine.","LocalizedString":"Your LIGHT INFANTRY units have Alpine."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_67th_baranovichi_history","SourceString":"The 67th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 20th Rifle Division of the Red Army during WWII. The division was first formed during the Russian Civil War and fought with the Red Army between 1919 and 1921, and disbanded afterwards. In 1944 it was formed again and saw extensive combat in operations such as Operation Bagration, the East Prussian Offensive and Prague Offensive, and it ended the war near Berlin with the 28th Army of the 1st Ukrainian Front. The division was awarded the Order of the Red Banner during the war, and received the honorific title \"Baranovichi\". It was also awarded the Order of Suvorov 2nd class. The 20th Rifle Division was transferred to Lida with the 28th Army after the war and disbanded in July 1946.","LocalizedString":"The 67th Infantry Regiment was a unit of the 20th Rifle Division of the Red Army during WWII. The division was first formed during the Russian Civil War and fought with the Red Army between 1919 and 1921, and disbanded afterwards. In 1944 it was formed again and saw extensive combat in operations such as Operation Bagration, the East Prussian Offensive and Prague Offensive, and it ended the war near Berlin with the 28th Army of the 1st Ukrainian Front. The division was awarded the Order of the Red Banner during the war, and received the honorific title \"Baranovichi\". It was also awarded the Order of Suvorov 2nd class. The 20th Rifle Division was transferred to Lida with the 28th Army after the war and disbanded in July 1946."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::WinterWar","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Passive","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardEnterPlay","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardLeaveBoardOrOwner","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardSpawnedInHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDrawnFromDeck","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardReset","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardCreatedAlterCard"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Alpine"],"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/CandidateArtwork/Winter_War/t_winter_soviet_inf.t_winter_soviet_inf","SubPathString":""},"ImageAnchor":"EImageAnchor::Top","artist":"Soviet WW2 post